      "description": "The best AI recording hardware?\nYou may already own it.\n\nTurn your Apple Watch into your all-day AI recorder. Capture the words and the life around them. Give AI more than a question. Give it the context to understand your day.\n\nNo extra recorder. No new routine.\nPut on your Watch. Go live your life.\n\nALL DAY. ON YOUR WRIST.\nConversations at work. Ideas on a walk. Words from someone you love. Start recording on your Watch, tap to mark a moment, and revisit it on your iPhone.\n\nBuilt for long sessions: in an Auday team test, Apple Watch Series 11 recorded for 12.5 hours with 49% battery remaining. One less device to carry. One less device to charge.\n\nMORE THAN A RECORDING.\nWhen your heart raced, what were you talking about? When things got tense, what was going on?\n\nBring conversations together with heart rate, stress estimates, activities, sleep and places. Follow body cues back to the original words. See more of the story, not just the transcript.\n\nYOUR PERSONAL LIFE MENTOR.\nSome questions deserve more than a generic answer.\n\n\"Could I have handled that conversation better?\"\n\"What really matters to me in this relationship?\"\n\"What should I take away from this week?\"\n\nExplore your questions with an AI grounded in your conversations, body context and lived moments. Get an outside perspective. Notice what you missed. Follow citations back to the words behind an answer.\n\nREFLECT ON YOUR DAY. GROW FROM IT.\nA day is more than a date on a calendar. Revisit your timeline, discover Highlights and let AI bring your day together in a daily reflection. Look again at your feelings and choices. Take something from today into tomorrow.\n\nMORE REMEMBERED. MORE UNDERSTOOD.\nThe people you care about. Your preferences. Plans mentioned in passing. Little details that make you, you.\n\nSaved memories give future conversations a place to begin. Review, edit or deactivate them. You decide what stays.\n\nSEARCH THE WAY YOU REMEMBER.\nForgot the exact words? Search by meaning instead. Find the conversation, the plan, the passing idea. Chinese and English transcription, with keyword and semantic search on your iPhone.\n\nThen go beyond the transcript. Hear the voice. Feel the atmosphere. Replay saved audio and return to that moment.\n\nALMOST EVERYTHING RUNS LOCALLY.\nWE DON'T EVEN HAVE SERVERS.\nYour devices handle recording, transcription, semantic search and archive storage.\n\nYou choose the AI. Connect a compatible provider with your own API key for Highlights, summaries, daily reflections and Chat. Relevant text and context go directly to that provider, never through an Auday server. These AI features do not upload original audio.\n\nYour life doesn't need a place on our servers.\nWe don't have any.\n\nBUY ONCE. NO AUDAY SUBSCRIPTION.\nThe local edition is a one-time purchase. Recording, local transcription, search and playback incur no AI provider fees. Optional AI uses your own provider and API key; provider charges are separate.\n\nGo live your day.\nCome back to it with Auday.\n\nGOOD TO KNOW\nRequires iOS 18+ and a paired Apple Watch with watchOS 11+. Health and location context are optional. Stress estimates support reflection, not medical diagnosis. Recording depends on battery, storage and system conditions; the battery figure is one team test, not a runtime guarantee. Audio follows your retention settings; keep important content separately. Give notice and obtain required consent before recording others.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://auday.ai/privacy\nTerms of Service: https://auday.ai/terms",
